### (f) MARK DIRECTION CONVENTION (from pmarks itself)
  SAMEKH = setumah (closed section), PE = petuchah (open section), recorded on the verse the mark FOLLOWS. Masoretic paragraph evidence: it informs a boundary and never decides one alone, and translation formatting never drives a boundary at all (E-23).
